        <h1>Plumbing Lead Generation: How to Get More Qualified Calls and Booked Jobs</h1>
        <p class="lf-lede">Good plumbing lead generation connects local customer demand to the right service, qualifies each inquiry and makes it easy to schedule the next step.</p>
      </div>
